OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas hope as 15-month path
OL,4,Aclosure lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner has shared her relief
OL,7,Fafter a 15-month road and path closure
OL,8,Fwas lifted ahead of her busiest time of
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FHallstile Bank in Hexham,
OL,12,FNorthumberland, was closed to cars and
OL,13,Fpedestrians on 30 July 2025 after a
OL,14,Ftwo-tonne chimney collapsed through the
OL,15,Froof of a building. No-one was injured
OL,16,Fbut several homes were evacuated at the
OL,17,Ftime.
OL,19,FThe footpath reopened in October and
OL,20,Fthe road followed on Monday,
OL,21,FNorthumberland County Council said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
