OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas hope as 15-month path
OL,4,Aclosure lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlison Smith, owner of eco-gift store
OL,7,FMatthias Winter, said: "Last year we
OL,8,Fwere affected by loss of trade running
OL,9,Fup to Christmas and we were fearful the
OL,10,Fsame thing would happen this year."
